@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix void: <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/wikidataMatchDescription> a owl:DatatypeProperty,
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource>,
        <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/turtle#Resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Wikidata-Match-Beschreibung"@de,
        "Wikidata match description"@en ;
    void:inDataset <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/Brandenburg_5000_BC_Data> ;
    rdfs:comment """Audit note in plain text describing how this administrative entity was matched against Wikidata: method (exact / fuzzy / override / transitive P131+), normalisation steps applied, search label and matched label, and the confidence score. Carried over verbatim from the matchReason field produced by wikidata_map.py during CSV enrichment.

Multiple rdfs:domain triples are used (Land, Bundesland, Kreis, Gemeinde) rather than owl:unionOf, to keep auto-generated SHACL shapes simple — the auto-generator picks the first domain. The semantic restriction is: the property applies to any of the four administrative-area classes."""@en ;
    rdfs:domain <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/Bundesland>,
        <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/Gemeinde>,
        <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/Kreis>,
        <http://w3id.org/bb5kbc/ont/Land> ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

